              "title": "Aberration",
              "desc": "· Increases the Agent's Anomaly Buildup Rate <color=#2BAD00>by 20%</color>.\n· When inflicting <color=#FFFFFF>Attribute Anomaly</color> on enemies, all squad members <color=#2BAD00>gain 60 points of Anomaly Proficiency</color>, and DMG caused by <color=#FFFFFF>Disorder</color> <color=#2BAD00>increases by 40%</color> for 15 seconds."
            },
            "69010302": {
              "title": "Frosty Thunder",
              "desc": "· The Agent's <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color> and <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color> will <color=#2BAD00>increase by 25%</color>.\n· DMG dealt by <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>Dodge Counter</color>, and <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attack</color> <color=#2BAD00>increases by 40%</color>, ignoring <color=#2BAD00>15%</color> of the enemy's DEF."
            },
            "69010303": {
              "title": "Rapid Aid",
              "desc": "· The Agent's Energy generation rate <color=#2BAD00>increases by 25%</color>, and the DMG dealt by <color=#FFFFFF>Quick Assist</color> <color=#2BAD00>increases by 50%</color>.\n· Each use of <color=#FFFFFF>Quick Assist</color> increases all squad members' ATK by <color=#2BAD00>10%</color> for 20s, stacking up to 3 times. Repeated triggers reset the duration."
            }
          }
